WEBVTT

00:11:00.230 --> 00:11:03.330
On which of these two companies
would you bet your money?

00:11:03.763 --> 00:11:08.130
Which of these two do you think
will be more successful in the long run?

00:11:09.097 --> 00:11:12.597
To solve the climate crisis,
there's still a lot we need to figure out.

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:14.797
There are many challenges
we need to overcome.

00:11:15.330 --> 00:11:18.197
But economics
don't have to be one of them.

00:11:18.663 --> 00:11:19.830
Thank you.